   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": "# 10. Results Summary   \n  \nComparison of results on WikiQA and TREC-QA (clean) test sets, reproducing the key findings from Tables 3 and 4 of the paper: positional attention improves over standard attention on both datasets.",
   "metadata": {
    "_uuid": "4733fb5d-a185-4c65-8cdf-d24a733c2406",
    "_cell_guid": "bf170579-a9bc-4be0-80aa-2886e1af7644",
